on" target="gram:fur"><abbr>für</abbr></ref></hi> oferseon <hi rend="italic">belegt <ref type="bibl" target="bib:CitToller">Toller</ref> die Bedeutung ‘verachten’ <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:aus"><abbr>aus</abbr></ref></hi> XI. <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Jahrhundert"><abbr>Jh</abbr></ref>.</hi>]</sense>
